==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|Abissinia||archaic}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|NL.|Abissīni}}<ref>{{R:OED Online|entry=Abyssin|pos=n|id=291148|date=2011}}</ref>, of {{m|NL.|Abissīnus||Abyssinian, Ethiopian}}, from {{der|en|ar|الْحَبَشَة}}, from {{m|ar|حَبَش||Abyssinian}}.<ref name=AHD>{{R:American Heritage Dictionary|edition=1971|page=6}}</ref> The humorous use of ''Abyssinia'' as a parting phrase is due to its phonetic resemblance to ''I'll be seeing ya''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˌæb.ɪˈsɪn.i.ə/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˌæb.ɪˈsɪn.i.ə/|/ˌæb.əˈsɪn.i.ə/|/ˌæb.əˈsɪn.jə/}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪniə|s=5}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɪnjə|s=4}}

